	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I can't believe how much everything's changed.”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Akari exclaims, taking in the sight of the cafeteria with wide eyes.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No kidding.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Republican and Imperial students are amicably sharing tables and eating side-by-side.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"The uneasy tension of the past is no more.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Not just here in the academy, but all throughout the Empire, people are surely enjoying a peaceful lunchtime.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"That's right─order has been restored to the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"It all started when Warren departed for the Republic around three months ago.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"There, he was severely injured by a firearm malfunction and forced to undergo emergency medical treatment in the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"He apparently lost his eyesight and will be entering into an involuntary early retirement.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Following that, Elsa took over as governor-general and, in collusion with Empress Hisui, successfully deposed Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Thus, the Empire was liberated from oppression.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"The Republican Army has been winding down its occupation, and many officers, including Rochel, have already been expatriated.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"The full withdrawal is expected to take place by the end of the year, leaving behind only a small rump force.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"The Sworn Blades have taken over security duties at the Imperial Palace, and Hotori now proudly wears her blade wherever she goes.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Having recovered their lost honor, the warriors are gradually winning back the people's trust with each passing day.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"All of which leads to the present day, where the Empire is undergoing reforms at a dizzying pace.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Never thought I'd live to see such a peaceful age free from strife.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It really feels like Oomikami worked a miracle, doesn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I can't afford to rest now, either.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"In preparation for the transition to a constitutional monarchy and the establishment of a parliament, Akari has founded her own political party.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Though she hasn't revealed her lineage, she's still managed to gather a large following.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"She's so popular, in fact, that the media and the public have all but coronated her as the first prime minister.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"That said, there's one more person who was instrumental in bringing this new Empire into fruition.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“How's it hanging, you two?”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"The very person in question jaunts towards us, a full plate of meat in each hand.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Shino's been throwing the full weight of her\nconglomerate's finances behind the Empire's reforms.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Without the backing of wealthy business interests, Elsa and Kanami's new government would never have gotten off the ground.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
{"font", size=53},
"And Shino, with her Imperial father and Republican mother, has been working tirelessly to network and build bridges between financiers and industrialists in our two countries.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"At any rate, there's no disputing that she's been a leading figure in the Empire's new birth of freedom.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Never a single speck of green, I see.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You know it.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Fried chicken, fried potatoes, fried cutlets... now that's what I call a balanced meal!”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Shino plops herself down right next to Akari.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“That reminds me, I've gotta favor to ask you, Miyaguni.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Mind letting me borrow Soujin for a bit?”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Say what?”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Shino flashes me a casual grin before continuing.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Y'see, I'm gonna be negotiating trade agreements with the Republic over the next couple of days, and I was thinking I could use some extra muscle.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“There's gonna be plenty of big-shots from both our countries attending, so it'd be a prime target for the anti-peacers.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"The anti-peace faction consists of Republicans who were staunch supporters of Warren.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"Their existence has been a persistent thorn in the new\nEmpire's side.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Though they haven't caused any major problems yet, rumors are swirling that they'll be taking drastic measures sooner rather than later.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If there's that many important people attending,\nshouldn't they be able to take care of their own security?”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Sure, the place'll be crawling with bodyguards, but almost all of 'em are gonna be taking care of Empress Hisui and Elsa.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Doubt they're gonna be able to spare any time watching over the rest of us plebeians.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“That's why I figured having a warrior by my side would be worth its weight in gold.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Makes sense. If that's all there is to it, go right ahead.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If my lord says so, I have no objections either.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Sick! I'll be countin' on you!”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Have a little fried chicken as a treat.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Shino smirks as she piles a veritable mountain of fried chicken onto my plate.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"I'm supposed to eat all this on my own?",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hahaha! Don't you worry, I'll be paying you handsomely for your services.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not sure how I feel about accepting money from a friend like this...”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“No, no, it's better to be upfront about stuff like this.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I fork over the cash, you accept it without any complaints, and both of us walk away feeling like we got a great deal.\nThat's how it works.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Feel free to buy yourself a bathtub of tofu and take a swim in it.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Now that's an idea. I think I just might.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“All righty, now I can focus on the conference tomorrow.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Shino declares before proceeding to shovel fried chicken into her mouth with aplomb.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori always says it, but you really are gonna get fat at this rate.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Nah, y'all just don't get it. There's no such thing as flab on this body here.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Don't believe me? Give it a touch and find out for yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Shino smugly declares, patting at her own belly.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Accepting her invitation, I press my fingertip against her remarkably toned abdomen.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hyaah?!”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Yo, what the hell? What do you think you're doing?!”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You said I should give it a touch.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"I get a smack on the back for my troubles.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“She was joking, genius!”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Still, you weren't lying. You don't have any─”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Nobody asked.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Shino glares at me, as though daring me to continue.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Miyaguni, don't you think your retainers need to learn some manners?”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You should know that Soujin wouldn't get a joke even if it hit him in the face.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Besides, your reaction just now was awfully cute.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“What're you talking about?”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'Hyaah?!'”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Forget about that.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Aw, what's the harm? It's cute. Right, Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. It was very charming.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Okay, okay, okay, that's it, no more, not one more word! This conversation is over! Done! Finished!”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Shino frantically waves her hands to put an end to the conversation.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Anyways, I'll be counting on you tomorrow, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“With that outta the way, I'm heading back to the classroom.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"Her face still flushed, Shino beats a hasty retreat from the cafeteria.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"The way her hair and skirt flutter behind her as she scurries away makes her look no different from any other schoolgirl.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I suppose even Shino has her cute moments, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm? Ah, yeah...”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Now that I think about it, she really is more of a 'girl' than a 'woman.'”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I mean, yeah. She ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"is",
{"/font"},
" still a student, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Right, I was just thinking how impressive it is that she's running her whole conglomerate at her age.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"The Kurushima Group is ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"the",
{"/font"},
" conglomerate behind the\nEmpire's economy and industry.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"The stress and workload that come from being its leader must be immense.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"And yet I've never once seen her show any signs of weakness.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"If anything, she completely pours herself into her work and even seems to revel in how busy she always is.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Her work ethic is truly impressive.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"And the stoutness of her heart surely doesn't lose to that of any warrior.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"That is the Kurushima Shino who personally sought to entrust her life into my hands.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"I'll have to do everything in my power to live up to her expectations.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You can count on me.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hmm? Whassat?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Akari peers up at me curiously, a spoonful of anmitsu dangling from her mouth.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, it's nothing.”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
